<!-- Hand-written repeats and voltas fixture for M6 Slices 12-15. Measures 2-5: a repeat (m2-m4)
     with a two-measure 1st ending (m3-m4, hooked) and a one-measure 2nd ending (m5, open).
     Measures 6-8: a repeat played three times (times="3") with a "1, 2" ending (m7) and a 3rd
     ending (m8, open, no label text). The 1st ending carries a default-y the model does not read. -->
